In addition to obscenity (ala _Miller_), the government regulates the
following on TV and radio:

  -- so-called indecency (ala _Pacificia_)
  -- so-called personal attacks
  -- political editorials
  -- selling time for polticial advertising

Also, Congress this term (1993) proposes to regulate:

   -- depictions of violence
   -- so-called fairness

